0,                      $ reserved
6,                      $ Link Path Size
"20 1E 24 01 30 08", 	$ Link Path to DOG object's fault value attribute.
0x0002,                 $ No support for settable path, scaling, scaling links, or
				$ real time update of value.  Value is gettable and 
				$ Settable.  Enumerated strings are supported.
0xC1,                   $ Data Type - BOOL
1,                      $ Data Size - (in bytes)
"Output Fault Value",   $ Parameter Name
"",                     $ Units String
			$$$$$$$$$$ Help string $$$$$$$$$$$
"If the Output Fault State parameter is set for 'Use Fault Value', then outputs can be set to turn all ON or turn all OFF with a communications fault.",
0,1,0,                	$ Min, Max (max enumeration #), and Default values
1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0;	$ Not Used

